DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssnnmmpp__hhaasstt module implements a private BEGEMOT-HAST-MIB, which allows
     management of HAST resources.

     The module uses the hastd(8) control socket to communicate with the dae‐
     mon.  The _h_a_s_t_C_o_n_f_i_g_F_i_l_e variable can be used to specify the location of
     the hast.conf(5) file to find the address of the control connection.

